          <span>Scrap My Car UAE is legally operated as Faizan Khan Used Auto Spare Parts Trading LLC, Al Sajaa Industrial Area, Sajaa, Sharjah, UAE.</span>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="page-shell">
      <div class="smc-container content-grid">
        <aside class="side-card">
          <div class="smc-kicker">Questions?</div>
          <h2>Contact us.</h2>
          <p>If you have a question about these terms or how they apply to a service request, contact the team.</p>
          <a class="smc-button smc-button-secondary" href="/contact-us">Contact Us</a>
