          <section>
            <h2>Definitions</h2>
            <p>In these terms, “we”, “our company”, “ScrapMyCarUAE.com” and “Scrap My Car UAE” refer to Faizan Khan Used Auto Spare Parts Trading LLC.</p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2>User eligibility</h2>
            <p>Users of the Scrap My Car UAE website must be of legal age to use the relevant services.</p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2>Confidentiality and personal information</h2>
            <p>Personal information collected through this website is handled in accordance with our Privacy Policy. By using the platform, you acknowledge the practices described there.</p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2>Registration and information provided</h2>
            <p>Certain website areas or services may require information from you. Providing inaccurate, incomplete or false information may result in access to a service being refused or delayed.</p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2>Code of conduct</h2>
            <p>Users agree not to misuse the website. This includes:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Restricting or preventing others from accessing the website.</li>
              <li>Using the website for illegal or unauthorised purposes.</li>
              <li>Attributing statements to Scrap My Car UAE without authorisation.</li>
              <li>Transmitting illegal, fraudulent or objectionable content.</li>
              <li>Copying, framing or duplicating website content without permission.</li>
              <li>Interfering with the website’s software, functions or security.</li>
              <li>Collecting information from other users without consent.</li>
              <li>Granting access to restricted parts of the website to unauthorised individuals.</li>
            </ul>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2>Accuracy of information</h2>
            <p>We aim to provide accurate and useful information, but users remain responsible for verifying information relevant to their own circumstances before relying on it.</p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2>Disclaimer</h2>
            <p>The website and services are provided on an “as-is” basis unless otherwise agreed in writing. We do not guarantee uninterrupted access or that all website information will always be error-free.</p>
          </section>

