            <p>We aim to keep the website available, but access may be limited or interrupted for maintenance, technical issues or other operational reasons.</p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2>Copyright claims</h2>
            <p>Copyright infringement concerns may be submitted to us for review. Appropriate action may be taken where a valid claim is received.</p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2>Jurisdiction and compliance</h2>
            <p>Users are responsible for complying with laws and requirements applicable to them when using the website and services.</p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2>Acceptance</h2>
            <p>By continuing to use the Scrap My Car UAE website, you agree to these terms and conditions. If you do not agree with any part of them, you should stop using the website and services.</p>
